== 1. compile a policy into a profile ==
include_profile linux
sandbox/lock:off
allow/lpath,npath,rpath,readdir,wpath,cpath,tpath,fattr+@SCRATCH@/allow
allow/lpath,npath,rpath,readdir,wpath,cpath,tpath,fattr+@SCRATCH@/allow/***
allow/lpath,npath,rpath,exec+@SCRATCH@/allow
allow/lpath,npath,rpath,exec+@SCRATCH@/allow/***
deny/lpath,npath,rpath,readdir+@SCRATCH@/deny/secret.txt
deny/lpath,npath,rpath,readdir+@SCRATCH@/deny/secret.txt/***
PROFILE=@SCRATCH@/sydbox.syd-3
mode=600 (expect 600)

